      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WYNDRA ALL SMOKE (8) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from five tries. In the money last time at Townsville (28.73) in a OPEN, finishing a 5.5 lengths third. Looks well placed and should feature. SCOTCH ROCKET (1) turned in a plain effort last time when seventh at Q Lakeside over 457m behind Koby Keeping (25.93) in a Grade 4/5. Can figure in the finish. WAIKARIE VENOM (2) was out of character last run when missing the frame, finishing eighth (29.77) in a OPEN at Townsville. Drifted back and never in it from the wide draw. Solid record here at the distance winning six races. Warrants plenty of respect. POZZI TONOZZI (4) is worth some thought after placing last start.",
